  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_01",
      "hash64": "A2E66B60342948D4",
      "text": "Ooooh oh oh oh! Ooooh oh oh oh![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_02",
      "hash64": "A2E66E6034294DED",
      "text": "Un paesaggio ricoperto d’argento immacolato\\na perdita d’occhio! Argento 925, oserei dire![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_01",
      "hash64": "21F2B91E9A6ED63E",
      "text": "Già! E grazie a questi vestiti che hai scelto,\\nnon temiamo minimamente neanche il freddo![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_03",
      "hash64": "A2E66D6034294C3A",
      "text": "Ci mancherebbe! Scelgo solo capi delle migliori\\nmarche, confezionati con i tessuti più pregevoli![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_02",
      "hash64": "21F2B81E9A6ED48B",
      "text": "Quasi provo pena per i poveretti che affrontano\\nla scalata senza indossare vestiti come questi.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_04",
      "hash64": "A2E66860342943BB",
      "text": "Mh? No, non ci credo! Ma non è l’immancabile\\nplebe[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_03",
      "hash64": "21F2B71E9A6ED2D8",
      "text": "Hai ragione! Quel suo portamento\\nevidentemente plebeico è indubbio![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_04",
      "hash64": "21F2BE1E9A6EDEBD",
      "text": "Per tutti i tappeti rossi! Abby cara, hai notato\\nquanto è leggera la stoffa dei suoi vestiti?[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_05",
      "hash64": "A2E6676034294208",
      "text": "Più che vestiti, a me sembra che indossi\\ncarta straccia![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_06",
      "hash64": "A2E66A6034294721",
      "text": "Nab caro, devo saperlo: non sarà che i plebei\\nresistono al freddo?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_05",
      "hash64": "21F2BD1E9A6EDD0A",
      "text": "Non saprei... Ma pare che quando non hanno\\nsoldi dicano di andare in \"braghe di tela\"...[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_06",
      "hash64": "21F2BC1E9A6EDB57",
      "text": "Quindi forse sono abituati a vestire leggeri.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_07",
      "hash64": "A2E669603429456E",
      "text": "Nab caro, non ho parole...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_08",
      "hash64": "A2E6646034293CEF",
      "text": "Sei un vero erudito! Ti concederò in premio\\nil mio esclusivissimo Abbyentino d’oro![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_07",
      "hash64": "21F2BB1E9A6ED9A4",
      "text": "Evviva![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_09",
      "hash64": "A2E6636034293B3C",
      "text": "Come è noto, tendere la mano ai plebei\\nbisognosi è il dovere di noi Celebrità...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_10",
      "hash64": "A2E2E660342630FE",
      "text": "Perciò mi auguro che questo modestissimo regalo\\nla aiuti ad affrontare coraggiosamente il freddo.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_11",
      "hash64": "A2E2E760342632B1",
      "text": "Plebe[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, mi ascolti. Ha presente il detto\\n\"mani fredde, cuore caldo\"? Ecco, sono tutte\\r\\nsuperstizioni.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_12",
      "hash64": "A2E2E46034262D98",
      "text": "Non deve scordarlo mai...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_08",
      "hash64": "21F2B21E9A6ECA59",
      "text": "Abby cara, sei ammirevole! Le tue Trittiperle\\ndi saggezza sembrano sempre più frasi a caso![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_13",
      "hash64": "A2E2E56034262F4B",
      "text": "Bene! Nab caro, purtroppo la nostra vacanza\\nvolge al termine...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_woman_14",
      "hash64": "A2E2EA60342637CA",
      "text": "Per concludere in bellezza, mi piacerebbe\\nammirare dall’alto il [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]centro esatto[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] di Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_09",
      "hash64": "21F2B11E9A6EC8A6",
      "text": "Ah-ah! Vuoi guardare dall’alto in basso perfino\\nun posto straordinario come quello! Abby cara,\\r\\nnon esiste Celebrità più altezzosa di te![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_man_10",
      "hash64": "21EFB41E9A6C97E8",
      "text": "Non credo che si possa entrare nella voragine,\\nma vorrei fare comunque domanda alla Lega\\r\\nPokémon![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_secretary_01",
      "hash64": "6AFA1D9089B75514",
      "text": "I signori Nab e Abby sono andati a scalare\\nuna montagna tanto immacolata quanto\\r\\nla reputazione della nostra azienda.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_008_secretary_02",
      "hash64": "6AFA209089B75A2D",
      "text": "A dire il vero... non so se la reputazione della\\nnostra azienda sia poi così immacolata...\\c\\nAd ogni modo, la più famosa montagna bianca\\ndi Paldea è senz’altro la Sierra Napada.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
